As she navigated this new landscape, she couldn't help but feel a sense of uncertainty about what was driving her exhaustion. Was there something in her work environment that was exacerbating the issue? Or was it simply a matter of chance, a rare instance of chaos in an otherwise predictable routine? Only time would tell if she could identify any underlying causes and find ways to mitigate their effects.
