ASSISTANT: Walk me through the last time your phone interrupted studying.

USER: I've been trying to make sense of this: a group notification appeared around 9 p.m. I meant to check it for a minute, but I kept scrolling for almost two hours and went to bed guilty. That's what keeps standing out to me.

