Managing finances has become a source of significant stress, with unexpected fees continually appearing. A recent invoice, left unopened for ten days due to slow work, ultimately incurred a late fee, further exacerbating the anxiety. In moments when administrative tasks feel overwhelming, the user finds solace in coworking calls on Fridays, where the presence of others working nearby seems to provide a sense of normalcy and motivation.
