Money has become a source of significant stress, with invoices frequently appearing without warning. Recently, an invoice went unopened for ten days, providing a brief respite from its anxiety-inducing presence. However, when the late fee was added, the sense of overwhelm intensified.

In moments of relative calm, administrative tasks can be managed more easily. For instance, during a Friday coworking call, having someone else nearby seems to spark productivity and help the user get started on tasks like managing finances.
